s go  into a 1 to 3 second animation which  looks cool but also can be beneficial  during fights during the short cutscene  you are completely invincible which  means you are dealing damage with no  worries about taking any damage try to  use these sync attacks to your advantage  while in a hectic situation hopefully  these tips will give you the fighting  edge against vicious chimeras if you  have any additional tips you found a  while out on the battlefield let us know  in the comments below thanks for  watching  [Music]
 

